   <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/relationfunction">Determine if a Relation is a Function</link></item>
   <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/vertlinetest">Vertical Line Test</link></item>
   <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/introtofunction">Introduction to Functions</link></item>
   <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/vertlinegraph">Vertical Line Test on Graph</link></item>
   <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/onetoone">One-to-one Functions</link></item>
   <item><link url="https://openstax.org/l/graphonetoone">Graphs as One-to-one Functions</link></item>
